%% Topic 4 answers — examiner's-eye box; included by T4QA and the compiled QA volume.

::: eye | "Critically" is the command word of Topic 4
Almost every question here says "critically review", "critically analyse", "critical gender analysis" or "critically evaluate". Notice the pattern in the answers below: every theory or approach gets (1) what it says, (2) what it says or assumes about women, (3) its **gender critique**, and (4) a **Pakistani example**. Notice also how the same material — Boserup, Mies, Elson, Moser, Kabeer, Wallerstein — is re-cut for each question. The near repeats (WID/WAD/GAD in 2016 and 2021; colonial and capitalist perspectives in 2023 and 2024) are answered separately to show how to fit old knowledge to new wording.
:::
